<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-297] created_by in file meta data doesn&apos;t contain parquet library version</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-297</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;E.g. in a file produced with parquet 1.6.0 created_by = &quot;parquet-mr (build 6aa21f8776625b5fa6b18059cfebe7549f2e00cb)&quot;, while it should be &quot;parquet-mr version 1.6.0 (build 6aa21f8776625b5fa6b18059cfebe7549f2e00cb)&quot;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Two problems populating Version.VERSION_NUMBER&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;getJarPath() is broken&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;readVersionNumber() reads wrong file from the wrong jar file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
